      "content": "hey i'm planning a solo trip to london in a few months and wanted a bit of a deep dive on safety. i want to see the cool spots but also wanna know which areas i should probably avoid or just be extra careful in? like, where are the spots that have a bit more of an unpredictable vibe or where tourists might feel out of place? thanks!",
