      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "London is a vibrant city and generally a safe destination. Nonetheless, it's good to exercise caution in more crowded areas or at night. Consider visiting places like Covent Garden, Soho, and Camden, which are vibrant but also attract celebrated vagrants and street hustlers. Be wary of pickpockets, especially in Tube stations and tourist-heavy spots. It's advisable to stay aware of your surroundings, keep personal belongings secure, and use common sense wherever you explore! Avoid places that feel overly debris-filled or dimly lit at odd hours, as they may not be as safe. Enjoy your trip planning!",
